abstract: >-
  This dataset provides a comprehensive, structured collection of doctoral theses defended in France between
  1985 and 2025. Each record corresponds to a single defended PhD thesis and includes detailed information on
  the thesis itself, the individuals involved (author, supervisors, jury members), and associated institutions.
